            <div xml:id="m-078fdc75-6964-4727-9435-172f6edbb3ab">
              <lg xml:id="m-acf30413-531c-4457-891e-fe8bdc8d48fe">
                <l xml:id="m-a625acf1-44bb-44f3-b63b-1def3ef879a7" facs="#m-7e5226c5-64f2-40a5-a51b-afecf3a873ef" label="text-like">Feast of the Sacred Heart of Jesus.</l><l xml:id="m-fed75973-a304-4e15-af85-be79af01a02b" facs="#m-d717cafc-e3ed-4c50-95f8-b0b40071e425" label="ambiguous">e71</l><l xml:id="m-71184e3e-3eeb-4fa6-9e00-a9a8ac86c7c2" facs="#m-24388526-6883-40f7-aed4-f091bb12edbe" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-ca9bf97f-1dbf-43b0-b49a-9a8d9733285b" facs="#m-4be92e9d-391d-43c8-b76c-dda901efeff1" label="lyrics-like">Eus qui nobis, in Corde Filii pietátis nostrae praestántes obsé¬</l><l xml:id="m-b2f43fe5-decb-48d1-a9e0-1277e8f68119" facs="#m-96b1e5ea-8c7a-41b1-a3aa-8d08c0cd56c2" label="lyrics-like">tui, nostris vulneráto peccátis,</l><l xml:id="m-4b76958e-1be7-4958-aa49-d6163ada63c2" facs="#m-a8c90f54-193c-4de9-80e0-af72a086d38f" label="ambiguous">quium, * dignae quoque satisfa¬</l><l xml:id="m-d2b840d1-a2c8-45a9-b882-b3d434e6a6fc" facs="#m-3faa0339-3ed0-4830-8eb6-099edb3c7bb9" label="lyrics-like">infinitos dilectiónis thesáuros mise¬</l><l xml:id="m-0ebd2aa3-4302-46be-8be7-2b8330fce11a" facs="#m-6ea111a7-46f0-45c2-a77e-8d95bd31dc50" label="lyrics-like">ctiónis exhibeámus officium. Per</l><l xml:id="m-a8ec1759-084c-4e28-a164-96cc07fae1ac" facs="#m-4e934577-fb81-461b-ab71-591fef2eec9b" label="lyrics-like">ricórditer largiri dignáris; t con¬</l><l xml:id="m-87628b6c-5358-4fa6-a117-63423d592e61" facs="#m-b86d075f-7a9f-4927-a570-6d1d9b510977" label="lyrics-like">eúmdem Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-efc3b6f5-cd58-4835-ad6f-d36573acc524" facs="#m-afa72e92-7687-4d5e-bcc1-1b89c277b668" label="lyrics-like">céde, quaésumus, ut illi devótum</l><l xml:id="m-a31cd16a-9787-4407-831f-cfc6c35bddcc" facs="#m-a815e18d-19d2-448a-90d1-b354379b63b2" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Ephesios.</l><l xml:id="m-670d031b-3a73-415e-8af4-d7a4631f3b21" facs="#m-d375bbbe-1d2a-4ee6-8657-b75db664790e" label="ambiguous">Ephes. 3.</l><l xml:id="m-fcd3adfe-4e06-4841-9ae3-a5f141e390c1" facs="#m-385a227a-3add-43d8-8b12-2838d64a9937" label="lyrics-like">CRatres: Mihi, ómnium sanctó-mea ad Patrem Dómini nostri Jesu</l><l xml:id="m-10e6c8b8-bdae-4d5a-860a-28a828a5da8c" facs="#m-e0b4b104-605a-41c9-9701-95dee1636a75" label="lyrics-like">rum mínimo, data est grátia</l><l xml:id="m-2ca3142e-ba0d-4edb-9ba9-ed2380d27383" facs="#m-b4be4388-66e7-48ca-a87d-a8e4a70a9d5e" label="lyrics-like">Christi, ex quo omnis patérnitas in</l><l xml:id="m-724be843-bcdc-45c0-8a3c-f2062c38387f" facs="#m-b82b9be0-d629-4868-80a1-94c337f5e913" label="lyrics-like">haec, in géntibus evangelizâre in¬</l><l xml:id="m-1e0df5e3-b74c-4c0a-ad8d-5406f9d2b776" facs="#m-43b3c21a-1ed8-4b36-86e5-c1a82c415431" label="lyrics-like">caelis et in terra nominátur, ut det</l><l xml:id="m-5ddb5287-0903-4a63-93dd-b2db46f80e0a" facs="#m-9f45a4f0-dd4d-45d3-967f-c9dc1cccb2f3" label="lyrics-like">vestigábiles divitias Christi, et illu¬</l><l xml:id="m-4354ae68-2f67-4696-b86d-64fb1e4e5964" facs="#m-2d4c13fb-bde2-402d-8b2b-36c3dd8453ff" label="lyrics-like">vobis secúndum divitias glóriae</l><l xml:id="m-ca6c5574-7d8e-45e5-afbe-2729731e002a" facs="#m-0da50146-abfb-4b3d-9946-de5acbabf41d" label="lyrics-like">minâre omnes, quae sit dispensátio</l><l xml:id="m-50f43a5a-756d-43e1-8f4c-c2748a0c664a" facs="#m-ab13d8aa-0b5c-4f0f-858b-13f98764240f" label="lyrics-like">suae, virtúte corroborári per Spíri¬</l><l xml:id="m-3de4d6f1-0d52-403d-9168-faf5c77bfafe" facs="#m-376ce324-0ba7-4efb-a1f1-1c9f158b7538" label="lyrics-like">sacraménti abscónditi a saéculis in</l><l xml:id="m-a828be4f-fba2-49d6-84cd-c9fc7d112042" facs="#m-9b34108e-7f19-4dff-812a-3bcc919c04be" label="lyrics-like">tum ejus in interiórem hóminem,</l><l xml:id="m-501c83cb-10d1-46d1-9b57-386d96c07403" facs="#m-a4791290-c1f2-452e-9efc-9ab3769da654" label="lyrics-like">Christum habitáre per fidem in</l><l xml:id="m-4fc4bdab-a533-4607-b975-e3afb4d14298" facs="#m-c018944a-18a7-45d3-aa75-c5ac424c622f" label="lyrics-like">Deo, qui ómnia creávit : ut inno¬</l><l xml:id="m-930fa391-34ff-4b26-9793-b7f0b3fecb31" facs="#m-e07d4c97-224e-4fa7-8f14-bd53ee58d53a" label="lyrics-like">téscat principátibus et potestátibus</l><l xml:id="m-8cf91258-6d86-4499-a213-c393480d7e08" facs="#m-866ec8d4-8e81-495f-8487-1121526ee9c4" label="lyrics-like">córdibus vestris: in caritáte radi¬</l><l xml:id="m-cde3c7ed-2805-4017-a387-9bf08b2fa804" facs="#m-88bbe9d1-3898-413a-b4f1-f2456b5cef99" label="lyrics-like">in caelëstibus per Ecclésiam multi¬</l><l xml:id="m-960ebbff-a411-4190-bfeb-e956035e2bf2" facs="#m-803e5486-61dd-4ecb-809c-4a741c7ca63e" label="lyrics-like">cáti et fundáti, ut possítis compre¬</l><l xml:id="m-c8de5dd0-4397-4add-8c3d-91765e391d1f" facs="#m-0418e5ad-83f9-4550-92f8-216545cb171a" label="lyrics-like">fórmis sapiéntia Dei, secúndum</l><l xml:id="m-40ecd634-d20a-4879-bb97-ba4285b53072" facs="#m-d23db632-c066-41b8-961c-3e87fb217dc2" label="lyrics-like">héndere, cum ómnibus sanctis, quae</l><l xml:id="m-0f5b6155-4883-42b4-b0f7-3f553ffb2adb" facs="#m-92e56f0b-3163-4440-9097-9dc547ac9f32" label="lyrics-like">praefinitiónem saeculórum, quam</l><l xml:id="m-f6cb8152-f44e-4846-8203-587eef55b90c" facs="#m-70733284-7ff3-45ee-9c4c-06872015d33a" label="lyrics-like">sit latitúdo, et longitúdo, et sublí¬</l><l xml:id="m-ef5205ea-099e-4c87-bfe1-fa1fe4b02cf3" facs="#m-1f3cd641-3d25-4a3a-b63d-baae706d6a7c" label="lyrics-like">fecit in Christo Jesu. Dómino no¬</l><l xml:id="m-11476990-bb7c-4010-87c2-d8279b0445e3" facs="#m-52d8b256-6966-4f91-8220-d1870f49f237" label="lyrics-like">mitas, et profúndum: scire étiam</l><l xml:id="m-ef9caa29-beab-49e0-9b32-e8e670ef3bb9" facs="#m-af9cc83e-abe9-4706-b45f-5d42fc55df3f" label="lyrics-like">stro, in quo habémus fidúciam et</l><l xml:id="m-285a3165-9714-4a84-ba7e-dffd8b09838a" facs="#m-dbff0d50-eabe-41fa-bc7c-bfaaa7f12b3c" label="lyrics-like">supereminéntem sciéntae caritátem</l><l xml:id="m-4d4c68f6-7d6e-464a-8200-10cf344dee1d" facs="#m-80fb16df-e870-44ce-a1a0-69a4c30b5764" label="lyrics-like">accéssum in confidéntia per fidem</l><l xml:id="m-bda6a2bf-29ea-4703-9710-e7c9e4df85ce" facs="#m-2af61845-9935-4e39-8c8d-490175846ef9" label="lyrics-like">Christi, ut impleámini in omnem</l><l xml:id="m-df61bad9-5b8d-4baf-86b0-a7dca7eb7587" facs="#m-d28a2a47-4293-4e0f-9007-59e750c516e3" label="lyrics-like">ejus. Hujus rei grátia flecto génua plenitúdinem Dei.</l><l xml:id="m-ac3c851f-088c-4bc2-ba4c-39c44a18b5ef" facs="#m-43be4cba-6b57-4b20-aea1-d0b5dd7bec97" label="ambiguous">Grad.</l><l xml:id="m-20e171b0-e99d-452c-a4aa-aef5c6ed0b3e" facs="#m-9ef5970b-a369-46ea-ba07-9d2d58f36e54" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-f11c3416-bc67-4364-91a2-0d2766963ae7" facs="#m-a1ce81cd-2826-46f3-9785-e06ab005dd3a" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-cc1044c6-44d8-4b7e-9deb-f6b6d9b0d5d0" facs="#m-bdd4a614-d11e-4d1f-bad6-e4209481dbd7" label="ambiguous">Ul- cis * et</l><l xml:id="m-4d307bb8-af74-4c7b-9f33-5ec875a5aaa2" facs="#m-44804ee9-3339-4e6e-9fc1-b7fcdc2583c9" label="lyrics-like">ré-ctus Dó¬ mi¬</l><l xml:id="m-4bced88f-b1a5-41ec-89f9-722373234a82" facs="#m-c87b3108-105a-425e-9bb1-956fddc2579c" label="lyrics-like">nus, pro-pter hoc légem dábit de- lin- quénti-bus in</l><l xml:id="m-be7fd20b-b7b9-4075-8ce7-02d013af9a1b" facs="#m-587aab24-5812-4b41-9766-e687c7061f15" label="lyrics-like">V. Dí-riget mansu-é-tos</l><l xml:id="m-3e75f72f-a15d-4d3a-a34c-5f64c5c32fb8" facs="#m-4ae7db54-64ab-467c-88e4-a9a8f83a7e5a" label="lyrics-like">ví¬</l><l xml:id="m-9a52d682-5985-4c28-9772-18a8d08413b2" facs="#m-f91e4587-ac7f-46b2-9003-9ab8112a5d35" label="ambiguous">a.</l><l xml:id="m-2d18c50c-fbf8-4f9f-b6af-a55c1b051028" facs="#m-0a8660d0-55f7-45b3-96e8-0c38b8371b46" label="lyrics-like">in judí-ci-o,</l><l xml:id="m-97a0417a-f3a0-4ab7-a595-3d042ab7127a" facs="#m-aa12021b-aa08-45eb-86c4-7725a338f6e8" label="lyrics-like">do-cé¬</l><l xml:id="m-184a9e23-3ad4-45d5-8bb8-ea2dd4041cc4" facs="#m-b267745f-3b18-4ae8-b1e3-73940438c890" label="lyrics-like">bit mí¬</l><l xml:id="m-c348fa3e-b56e-4277-a763-8973f0d650b2" facs="#m-ad71abf9-e218-45bf-88f4-643495ada9f4" label="lyrics-like">ví¬</l><l xml:id="m-fee53682-52b9-4eae-8f50-d0d4c440f20e" facs="#m-12f831be-6d89-4b0b-a083-802695fe9a87" label="ambiguous">tes</l><l xml:id="m-551488fc-afa9-406a-adc3-64fd30d50d25" facs="#m-68e6ad66-a444-44fb-b159-a852c1e469a6" label="lyrics-like">sú- as.</l><l xml:id="m-504163e7-1de6-4021-a2fc-91f145c4da58" facs="#m-15612f84-a030-498b-9965-60e846562d89" label="ambiguous">as</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>